  m_Region: "Nerves \xB7 Branch of CN VII"
  m_Description: "A slender branch of the facial nerve that crosses the middle ear
    between the malleus and incus, carrying taste from the front two thirds of the
    tongue \u2014 which is why middle-ear surgery can leave a metallic taste."
