  m_Description: "An S-shaped tube about 2.5 cm long \u2014 cartilage in its outer
    third, bone in its inner two thirds. Like an organ pipe closed at one end it
    resonates near 3 kHz, boosting the frequencies of speech by around 10 dB, and
    its glands make cerumen, earwax."
