  m_Region: "Middle ear \xB7 Ossicle"
  m_Description: "The middle ossicle. Its body meets the malleus head; its long process
    reaches down beside the malleus handle to the stapes. Because its arm is shorter
    than the malleus handle, the pair act as a lever that trades movement for about
    1.3\xD7 more force."
