  m_Region: "Cochlear duct \xB7 Section A"
  m_Description: "A gel flap hinged at the spiral limbus and resting on the outer
    hair cells' stereocilia. The basilar membrane and this lid pivot about different
    points, so as they rise and fall together they slide past each other \u2014 and
    that shear is what bends the stereocilia."
