  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_DisplayName: Cochlear nerve
  m_Region: "Nerves \xB7 Hearing"
  m_Description: "About 30,000 fibres, most of them wired to the inner hair cells,
    gathered from the spiral ganglion in the cochlea's hollow core (the modiolus).
    It carries both what you hear and when \u2014 its fibres fire in step with low-pitched
    sounds."
